# Paths whose changes the repository owner reviews before they reach main. This
# file requests that review; it does not enforce it: the "PR merge" ruleset's
# "Require review from Code Owners" is off, because a sole maintainer cannot
# approve their own PR. Turn it on once there is a second reviewer (the base
# branch's copy of this file then applies, so a PR cannot remove itself).
#
# CI workflows run with repository tokens; the image build context and CI build
# script decide what ends up in published images.
/.github/          @nbuckles13
/.dockerignore     @nbuckles13
/infra/ci/         @nbuckles13
